## Provenance

This project began as a fork of
[TomWhitwell/Turing-Pulse-Expander](https://github.com/TomWhitwell/Turing-Pulse-Expander).
No file of Tom Whitwell's remains in this repository — Pulses Plus is an
independent design that only shares the 16-pin expander ribbon interface with the
Music Thing Turing Machine.

Tom Whitwell's original Rev 2 expander files, and the earlier studies that fed
into this design, are kept in the archive repository:
https://github.com/kuangmk11/Turing-Pulse-Expander

Nothing in this licence grants rights over Tom Whitwell's work.

## Third-party material

`docs/sw-t2-4x-b-a2-ma2-data-sheet.pdf` is the manufacturer's datasheet for the
Taiway 200-MDP3 toggle switch, included for reference. It remains the property of
its publisher and is not covered by the licence above.
